With nothing revealed, fair value is 13 and the settlement ranges from 7 to 19. Quoting at the extremes of that range means an informed counterparty can never trade against me at a loss, while a noise trader who does trade gives me about 6 of edge. Moving either side in by 1 earns more from noise but loses more to informed traders, and nets out worse at this posterior (about 0.03 versus 0.07 per side).

